{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Amend rule requiring previous 2 years NI contributions for New Style ESA ",
        "additional_details": "Some people haven\u2019t been able to work due to long-term illness and disability and their previous many decades of Class 1 national insurance credits cannot be taken into account. Many people are in this terrible situation. Under old style ESA rules I would have qualified. The law needs to be changed by Parliament to allow this.",
        "background": "Change the law to allow someone to qualify for New Style ESA who has not been working in past two years due to illness and disability. I can't claim New Style ESA as the rules don't allow anyone who has not worked for the last 2 years to be eligible to claim.",
